<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
<meta name="description" content="French Bulldog information in English and Spanish. Información sobre el bulldog francés en inglés y español." />
<title>BulldogFrances.com | French Bulldog · Bulldog Francés</title>
<link rel="icon" href="https://www.bulldogfrances.com.ar/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
<style>
:root{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c2b38;background:#fff;color-scheme:light}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;min-width:0}
a{color:inherit}
.site-header{width:min(1200px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:0 auto;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e9ed;background:#fff}
.site-header-inner{width:100%;padding:18px 0}
.site-name{font:700 clamp(19px,2.2vw,27px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;text-decoration:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
main{width:min(1200px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(12px,2vw,24px) 0}
.cover{position:relative;border-radius:clamp(12px,2vw,24px);overflow:hidden;background:#f2efeb}
.cover img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.cover-brand{position:absolute;top:2.5%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:3;width:max-content;max-width:94%;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.86);color:#152538;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;font:700 clamp(20px,2.3vw,28px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.cover a.en,.cover a.es{position:absolute;top:12%;bottom:8%;width:32%;z-index:1;border-radius:12px}
.cover .en{left:0}.cover .es{right:0}
.cover a:focus-visible{outline:4px solid #214f81;outline-offset:-5px}
.language-intro{text-align:center;padding:clamp(22px,4vw,42px) 8px 12px}
.language-intro h1{font:700 clamp(23px,3.4vw,38px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px}
.language-intro p{font-size:clamp(14px,1.6vw,17px);line-height:1.5;color:#4b5662;margin:0}
.language-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(12px,2vw,22px);margin:20px auto 26px;max-width:920px}
.language-option{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(8px,1.5vw,16px);padding:clamp(14px,2.5vw,24px);border:1px solid #dce2e8;border-radius:16px;text-decoration:none;background:#fafbfd;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.language-option:hover,.language-option:focus-visible{border-color:#4d7295;background:#f0f6fc;outline-offset:3px}
.language-option img{width:clamp(34px,5vw,56px);height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;border-radius:4px}
.language-option strong{display:block;font:700 clamp(17px,2.3vw,25px)/1.2 Georgia,serif}
.language-option span{display:block;font-size:clamp(12px,1.5vw,15px);color:#596674;margin-top:4px}
.site-footer{width:min(1200px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:0 auto;border-top:1px solid #e5e9ed;padding:25px 16px 32px;text-align:center;color:#576473}
.site-footer nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 auto 14px}
.site-footer .footer-lang-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px 20px}
.site-footer a{font-size:14px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.site-footer small{font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:550px){.site-header-inner{padding:15px 0}.language-options{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:420px}.language-option{justify-content:flex-start}.cover a.en,.cover a.es{width:37%;top:12%;bottom:5%}.cover-brand{font-size:clamp(15px,4vw,22px);padding:5px 9px}.language-intro{padding-top:25px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<main>
<div class="cover" aria-label="Choose your language / Elegí tu idioma">
<a class="cover-brand" href="/">BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</a>
<img src="/bulldogfrances-portada-bilingue.webp" width="1671" height="941" alt="French Bulldog with English and Spanish edition labels and flags" fetchpriority="high" />
<a class="en" href="/en/" hreflang="en" aria-label="Enter English edition"></a>
<a class="es" href="/es/" hreflang="es" aria-label="Entrar a la edición en español"></a>
</div>
<section class="language-intro"><h1>One breed. Two languages. · Una raza. Dos idiomas.</h1><p>Choose your edition · Elegí tu edición para acceder a nuestras guías</p></section>
<nav class="language-options" aria-label="Language editions">
<a class="language-option" href="/en/" hreflang="en"><img src="/flags/us.svg" width="56" height="37" alt="" /><div><strong>English</strong><span>Explore the French Bulldog edition</span></div></a>
<a class="language-option" href="/es/" hreflang="es"><img src="/flags/es.svg" width="56" height="37" alt="" /><div><strong>Español</strong><span>Explorar la edición del bulldog francés</span></div></a>
</nav>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><nav aria-label="Legal and contact links by language"><div class="footer-lang-row" lang="en" aria-label="English links"><a href="/en/about/">About</a><a href="/en/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/en/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a></div><div class="footer-lang-row" lang="es" aria-label="Enlaces en español"><a href="/es/about/">Acerca de</a><a href="/es/contact/">Contacto</a><a href="/es/privacy/">Privacidad</a><a href="/es/affiliate-disclosure/">Aviso de afiliación</a></div></nav><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} BulldogFrances.com</small></footer>
</body>
</html>